- Monthly: ~10-12% monthly volatility → 1-month σ ≈ $92-110. 90% CI ≈ ±$150-180

Point estimates: slight upward drift assumption given AI semiconductor demand (~0.1-0.2% daily drift), but keeping near current price given uncertainty.

